's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"GhoKUp8LCHQ5KvXt6IrN2g","review_id":"ni5dzCSm0Lz1KRhBMyODdg","date":"2014-09-01T03:18:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.943919837474823,"text_excerpt":"We've been walking by this restaurant for over a year and finally went in for dinner. They apparently do a big brunch crowd, but it was pretty quiet on a Sunday night (which honestly was fine with us!). We are at the bar, and their new bartender Kelsey was very sweet and attentive. Food was CRAZY GOOD! We started with the deviled eggs and the boudin three ways, both of which were delicious. The pimento cheese was so good it was almost illegal, and the ravioli was great too. Had a great evening overall, and will definitely return."},{"business_id":"GhoKUp8LCHQ5KvXt6IrN2g","review_id":"XYTGzOKEzdEGMrGqK9LiNg","date":"2013-09-18T03:28:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9292987585067749,"text_excerpt":"I feel like Tivoli and Lee is the kind of place that I would avoid. I'm not a huge fan of restaurant/bars attached to hotels. They are typically expensive, not too friendly, and not that great. Tivoli and Lee punches that notion right out of the water! (Cafe Adelaide is another exception.) I first experienced the bar in May with Anna B. from Portland and her end of YSB event. Our bartender Hayley was amazingly friendly and spent hours chatting with our group and letting us experience new drinks and delicious snacks. I returned the other night for dinner and sat at the bar to wait for my friend to arrive. Hayley was bartending again and she remembered me and our group! She rehashed the sto..."},{"business_id":"GhoKUp8LCHQ5KvXt6IrN2g","review_id":"wo_5EUE2ACh_RS8CfK1juw","date":"2015-01-06T22:41:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9229192733764648,"text_excerpt":"Ah, possibly my new favorite brunch place in town. They have a great deal on bottomless mimosas and our waitress was so nice and attentive for our large group. I want to go back for dinner and I would go back to their brunch every Sunday if I could, specifically for their sloppy general benedict. I need to take a moment and rave about their collard greens. I don't know what sort of magic they put into them but those were the best damn collard greens in the city I've had so far. I would recommend reservations as the place is on the smaller side but this place is awesome: Great food (seriously those collard greens), appropriate portion sizes and prices, and free valet!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"GhoKUp8LCHQ5KvXt6IrN2g","photo_id":"-AgVw8qPSdurUgIIBNz53g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-AgVw8qPSdurUgIIBNz53g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8881140947341919},{"business_id":"GhoKUp8LCHQ5KvXt6IrN2g","photo_id":"4HZTzpgQ1lAcuxGO0Swh1w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/4HZTzpgQ1lAcuxGO0Swh1w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8751505613327026},{"business_id":"GhoKUp8LCHQ5KvXt6IrN2g","photo_id":"y7Wa0gYf2OP08ID_fgWN0A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/y7Wa0gYf2OP08ID_fgWN0A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8377651572227478},{"business_id":"GhoKUp8LCHQ5KvXt6IrN2g","photo_id":"GvPskeHT4ugypZytVXzvyA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GvPskeHT4ugypZytVXzvyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7984467148780823},{"business_id":"GhoKUp8LCHQ5KvXt6IrN2g","photo_id":"p5dgPkUyPHMvaPRIuzH6Kw","label":"outside","i